<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Guide Complet : S'installer en Australie - ZineInsight</title>
    <meta name="description"
        content="Guide complet pour réussir votre installation en Australie : logement, emploi, visa, culture, coût de la vie et conseils pratiques.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="Australie, expatriation, installation, guide, logement, emploi, visa, Sydney, Melbourne, Brisbane, Perth">

    <!-- Open Graph -->
    <meta property="og:title" content="Guide Complet : S'installer en Australie">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Guide d'expertise pour réussir votre expatriation en Australie">
    <meta property="og:image"
        content="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2070&q=80">

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --australia-blue: #00247D;
            --australia-red: #CF142B;
            --australia-white: #FFFFFF;
            --australia-navy: #001F3F;
            --warm-sand: #f8f6f0;
            --coral-red: #FF6B35;
            --ocean-blue: #006994;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--warm-sand) 0%, #ffffff 100%);
        }

        .hero-section {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 36, 125, 0.7), rgba(207, 20, 43, 0.7)),
                url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2070&q=80') center/cover;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            position: relative;
        }

        .nav-bar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .section-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--australia-blue), var(--australia-red));
            color: white;
            padding: 3rem 0;
            margin: 4rem 0 2rem 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -2px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
            background: var(--australia-blue);
        }

        .content-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin: 2rem 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .content-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .premium-badge {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--australia-blue), var(--ocean-blue));
            color: white;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 36, 125, 0.3);
        }

        .highlight-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f4ff, #e6efff);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--australia-blue);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
        }

        .city-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }

        .city-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .city-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .info-tag {
            background: var(--australia-red);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .discover-button {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--australia-blue), var(--australia-red));
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 36, 125, 0.3);
        }

        .discover-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 36, 125, 0.4);
            color: white;
        }

        .flag-emoji {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-right: 1rem;
        }

        .icon-australia {
            color: var(--australia-blue);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .testimonial-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 36, 125, 0.05), rgba(207, 20, 43, 0.05));
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--australia-blue);
        }

        .benefit-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-top: 3px solid var(--australia-red);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .benefit-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .stats-container {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--australia-navy), var(--australia-blue));
            color: white;
            padding: 3rem 0;
            margin: 3rem 0;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        .stat-item {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--australia-white);
        }

        .budget-bar {
            height: 8px;
            background: #e9ecef;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .budget-fill {
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }

        .budget-item {
            padding: 1rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
        }

        .budget-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .navigation-dots {
            position: fixed;
            right: 30px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            z-index: 999;
        }

        .dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(0, 132, 61, 0.3);
            margin: 10px 0;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .dot.active {
            background: var(--australia-blue);
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }

        .floating-action {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--australia-blue), var(--australia-red));
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 36, 125, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 998;
        }

        .floating-action:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(0, 36, 125, 0.6);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-section {
                height: 80vh;
                padding: 2rem;
            }
            .navigation-dots {
                display: none;
            }
            .city-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg nav-bar">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold" href="../index.html">
                <span class="flag-emoji">🇦🇺</span> ZineInsight Australie
            </a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#overview">Vue d'ensemble</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#cities">Villes</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#cost-living">Coût de la vie</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#employment">Emploi</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#visa">Visa</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#lifestyle">Mode de vie</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#education">Éducation</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="nav-item">
                        <a class="nav-link" href="#healthcare">Santé</a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Navigation Dots -->
    <div class="navigation-dots">
        <div class="dot active" data-section="hero"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="overview"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="cities"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="cost-living"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="employment"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="visa"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="lifestyle"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="education"></div>
        <div class="dot" data-section="healthcare"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Floating Action Button -->
    <button class="floating-action" onclick="scrollToTop()">
        <i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i>
    </button>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-section" id="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-lg-8 text-center">
                    <div class="flag-emoji mb-4">🇦🇺</div>
                    <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-4">Votre Nouvelle Vie en Australie</h1>
                    <p class="lead mb-5">Découvrez le guide complet pour réussir votre installation en Australie. 
                    Des plages dorées aux métropoles cosmopolites, l'Australie vous offre un mode de vie unique.</p>
                    <div class="premium-badge mb-4">
                        <i class="fas fa-star me-2"></i>Guide Premium Complet
                    </div>
                    <br>
                    <button class="discover-button btn-lg" onclick="document.getElementById('overview').scrollIntoView()">
                        <i class="fas fa-compass me-2"></i>Découvrir l'Australie
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Overview Section -->
    <section id="overview" class="py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">
                    <i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt me-3"></i>Pourquoi l'Australie ?
                </h2>
                <p class="lead">Une destination d'expatriation exceptionnelle</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="benefit-card">
                        <div class="icon-australia mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-sun fa-2x"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Climat Exceptionnel</h4>
                        <p>Plus de 300 jours de soleil par an dans la plupart des régions. Un climat qui favorise un mode de vie extérieur et actif.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="benefit-card">
                        <div class="icon-australia mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-chart-line fa-2x"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Économie Dynamique</h4>
                        <p>L'une des économies les plus stables au monde, avec des opportunités d'emploi dans tous les secteurs.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="benefit-card">
                        <div class="icon-australia mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-users fa-2x"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Société Multiculturelle</h4>
                        <p>Une société ouverte et accueillante, avec une forte tradition d'immigration et d'intégration.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stats-container">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="stat-item">
                                <div class="stat-number">25M+</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">Population</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="stat-item">
                                <div class="stat-number">8ème</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">PIB Mondial</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="stat-item">
                                <div class="stat-number">3ème</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">Qualité de Vie</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-3">
                            <div class="stat-item">
                                <div class="stat-number">30%</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">Population Née à l'Étranger</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Cities Section -->
    <section id="cities" class="py-5 bg-light">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">
                    <i class="fas fa-city me-3"></i>Principales Villes d'Australie
                </h2>
                <p class="lead">Découvrez les métropoles australiennes</p>
            </div>

            <div class="city-grid">
                <!-- Sydney -->
                <div class="city-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" 
                         class="card-img-top" alt="Sydney Opera House" style="height: 200px; object-fit: cover;">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">
                            <i class="fas fa-building me-2 icon-australia"></i>Sydney
                        </h5>
                        <p class="card-text">La ville emblématique avec l'Opéra et le Harbour Bridge. Centre économique et culturel.</p>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <span class="info-tag">5,3M habitants</span>
                            <span class="info-tag ms-2">Centre économique</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Marché du travail dynamique</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Vie culturelle riche</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Plages magnifiques</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Melbourne -->
                <div class="city-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514395462725-fb4566210144?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" 
                         class="card-img-top" alt="Melbourne" style="height: 200px; object-fit: cover;">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">
                            <i class="fas fa-palette me-2 icon-australia"></i>Melbourne
                        </h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Capitale culturelle de l'Australie, réputée pour sa scène artistique et gastronomique.</p>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <span class="info-tag">5,1M habitants</span>
                            <span class="info-tag ms-2">Capitale culturelle</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Scène artistique vibrante</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Cafés et restaurants</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Événements sportifs</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Brisbane -->
                <div class="city-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560518883-ce09059eeffa?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" 
                         class="card-img-top" alt="Brisbane" style="height: 200px; object-fit: cover;">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">
                            <i class="fas fa-sun me-2 icon-australia"></i>Brisbane
                        </h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Climat subtropical, lifestyle décontracté et proximité de la Gold Coast.</p>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <span class="info-tag">2,6M habitants</span>
                            <span class="info-tag ms-2">Climat subtropical</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Climat idéal toute l'année</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Coût de la vie abordable</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Proche de la Gold Coast</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Perth -->
                <div class="city-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570168007204-dfb528c6958f?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" 
                         class="card-img-top" alt="Perth" style="height: 200px; object-fit: cover;">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">
                            <i class="fas fa-gem me-2 icon-australia"></i>Perth
                        </h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Ville minière prospère avec de magnifiques plages et un style de vie décontracté.</p>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <span class="info-tag">2,1M habitants</span>
                            <span class="info-tag ms-2">Secteur minier</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Secteur minier lucratif</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Plages spectaculaires</li>
                            <li><i class="fas fa-check text-success me-2"></i>Moins de trafic</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Cost of Living Section -->
    <section id="cost-living" class="py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold">
                    <i class="fas fa-dollar-sign me-3"></i>Coût de la Vie en Australie
                </h2>
                <p class="lead">Budget réaliste pour vivre confortablement</p>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-8">
                    <div class="content-card">
                        <div class="card-body p-4">
                            <h4><i class="fas fa-home icon-australia me-2"></i>Logement</h4>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Sydney</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Studio centre : 1,800-2,500 AUD/mois</li>
                                        <li>• 1BR centre : 2,500-3,500 AUD/mois</li>
                                        <li>• 2BR banlieue : 2,000-3,000 AUD/mois</li>
                                        <li>• Colocation : 800-1,500 AUD/mois</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Melbourne</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Studio centre : 1,500-2,200 AUD/mois</li>
                                        <li>• 1BR centre : 2,200-3,000 AUD/mois</li>
                                        <li>• 2BR banlieue : 1,800-2,500 AUD/mois</li>
                                        <li>• Colocation : 700-1,200 AUD/mois</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <h4 class="mt-4"><i class="fas fa-shopping-cart icon-australia me-2"></i>Alimentation & Courses</h4>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Supermarché (par semaine)</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Couple : 150-200 AUD</li>
                                        <li>• Famille de 4 : 250-350 AUD</li>
                                        <li>• Célibataire : 80-120 AUD</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Restaurants</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Déjeuner rapide : 12-18 AUD</li>
                                        <li>• Dîner restaurant : 25-45 AUD</li>
                                        <li>• Café : 4-6 AUD</li>
                                        <li>• Bière : 8-12 AUD</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <h4 class="mt-4"><i class="fas fa-car icon-australia me-2"></i>Transport</h4>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Transport Public</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Pass mensuel Sydney : 217 AUD</li>
                                        <li>• Pass mensuel Melbourne : 169 AUD</li>
                                        <li>• Ticket simple : 3-5 AUD</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold">Voiture</h6>
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                        <li>• Essence : 1.60-1.80 AUD/L</li>
                                        <li>• Assurance : 100-200 AUD/mois</li>
                                        <li>• Parking CBD : 15-50 AUD/jour</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="content-card">
                        <div class="card-body p-4">
                            <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">Budget Mensuel Moyen</h5>
                            
                            <div class="budget-item mb-3">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                    <span><strong>Couple Sydney</strong></span>
                                </div>
                                <small class="text-muted">Vie confortable</small>
                                <div class="budget-bar bg-light rounded" style="height: 8px; position: relative;">
                                    <div class="budget-fill rounded" style="width: 85%; background: var(--australia-red); height: 100%;"></div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-end"><strong>6,500-8,000 AUD</strong></div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="budget-item mb-3">
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                    <span><strong>Couple Melbourne</strong></span>
                                </div>
